@startuml
[*] --> InventorySystem

state InventorySystem
InventorySystem : entry / System initialized
InventorySystem : do / Main Menu displayed

state AddGoods
AddGoods : entry / User selects "Add Goods"
AddGoods : do / User enters details for new goods
AddGoods : exit / Goods added to inventory

state UpdatePrice
UpdatePrice : entry / User selects "Update Price"
UpdatePrice : do / User selects item and enters new price
UpdatePrice : exit / Price updated

state RemoveGoods
RemoveGoods : entry / User selects "Remove Goods"
RemoveGoods : do / User selects item to remove
RemoveGoods : exit / Item removed from inventory

state ExpiredGoodsNotification
ExpiredGoodsNotification : entry / System detects expired goods
ExpiredGoodsNotification : do / User notified of expired goods
ExpiredGoodsNotification : exit / Expired goods removed

state PlaceOrder
PlaceOrder : entry / User selects "Place Order"
PlaceOrder : do / User specifies supplier and goods
PlaceOrder : exit / Order placed

state GenerateInvoice
GenerateInvoice : entry / Order placed
GenerateInvoice : do / Invoice generated
GenerateInvoice : exit / Invoice displayed

state SearchAndPurchase
SearchAndPurchase : entry / User selects "Search and Purchase"
SearchAndPurchase : do / User searches for items and selects for purchase
SearchAndPurchase : exit / Items selected

state CalculateDiscountAndTax
CalculateDiscountAndTax : entry / Items selected for purchase
CalculateDiscountAndTax : do / Discount and tax calculated
CalculateDiscountAndTax : exit / Total amount displayed

state GenerateReceipt
GenerateReceipt : entry / Purchase completed
GenerateReceipt : do / Receipt generated
GenerateReceipt : exit / Receipt displayed

state ReplaceOrCancelReceipt
ReplaceOrCancelReceipt : entry / During billing process
ReplaceOrCancelReceipt : do / User chooses to replace or cancel receipt
ReplaceOrCancelReceipt : exit / Receipt updated or cancelled

state RecordCustomerRequest
RecordCustomerRequest : entry / User requests unavailable item
RecordCustomerRequest : do / Request recorded
RecordCustomerRequest : exit / Confirmation displayed

state ViewSummaryReport
ViewSummaryReport : entry / User selects "View Summary Report"
ViewSummaryReport : do / Report generated and displayed
ViewSummaryReport : exit / Report displayed

InventorySystem --> AddGoods
InventorySystem --> UpdatePrice
InventorySystem --> RemoveGoods
InventorySystem --> ExpiredGoodsNotification
InventorySystem --> PlaceOrder
InventorySystem --> SearchAndPurchase
InventorySystem --> ViewSummaryReport

AddGoods --> InventorySystem : Add Goods Complete
UpdatePrice --> InventorySystem : Update Price Complete
RemoveGoods --> InventorySystem : Remove Goods Complete
PlaceOrder --> GenerateInvoice : Order Placed
GenerateInvoice --> InventorySystem : Invoice Generated
SearchAndPurchase --> CalculateDiscountAndTax : Items Selected
CalculateDiscountAndTax --> GenerateReceipt : Discount and Tax Calculated
ReplaceOrCancelReceipt --> InventorySystem : Receipt Modified
RecordCustomerRequest --> InventorySystem : Request Recorded
ViewSummaryReport --> InventorySystem : Report Viewed

@enduml
